#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/mirror.rst:43
msgid ""
"This effect/filter mirrors your image in any direction. It can also flip it "
"horizontally and vertically.  Compare :doc:`/effects_and_filters/"
"video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/flip_vertically`, :doc:`/"
"effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/"
"flip_horizontally` and :doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/"
"transform_distort_perspective/flippo` effects."
msgstr ""
"Tento efekt/filter zrkadlí váš obraz v ľubovoľnom smere. Môže ho tiež "
"prevrátiť horizontálne a vertikálne. Porovnajte efekty :doc:`/"
"effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/"
"flip_vertically`, :doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/"
"transform_distort_perspective/flip_horizontally` a :doc:`/"
"effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/flippo`."

