msgid ""
"Set the mirroring axis. By default, the right and bottom half are mirrored. "
"Use :guilabel:`Invert` to change this."
msgstr ""
"Nastaví os zrkadlenia. V predvolenom nastavení sa zrkadlí pravá a dolná "
"polovica. Na zmenu použite :guilabel:`Invertovať`."

